Keys
  1 … 6       Overview, Limits, Usage, Backends, Config, Graphs; tab / → next, s
  r           reload the config file on the proxy (Overview, Config); reset the 
  n enter d   add a limit, change the selected one, delete it: a guided form tha
              back as a sentence; ctrl+r saves and applies, ctrl+s saves only (L
  t /         dry-run a request against the rules; filter the table (Limits)
  e v         edit the file on disk (i insert, esc normal, ctrl+s save, ctrl+r s
              E $EDITOR); validate it with check-config (Config)
  g s f x     cycle group-by, sort, edit the hour range, export CSV; enter: hour
  space       pause the graphs (Graphs)
  ?           this help · q quit

